flowchart LR
 A[10000 distinct Buy actions] -->|Authenticated / rate limited| B[Bounded admission]
 B -->|Same stable key| C[Claim request key]
 C -->|Existing key and same hash| D[Replay stored response]
 C -->|New key| E[SQL UPDATE where available >= 1]
 E -->|One row changed| F[Hold + outbox + response COMMIT]
 E -->|Zero changed| G[OUT_OF_STOCK]
 F --> H[At most100 live holds before releases]
 H --> I[Payment success: held -> sold]
 H --> J[Terminal failure: held -> available]
